From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slothfulchat <patches@slothfulchat.invalid>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 00:37:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] web-app: stop a running download from its progress ring
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The progress ring gets an × button calling abort_download. It takes the
percentage's place on hover/focus, and for good on touch devices or
before the first percentage arrives; the arc keeps showing progress.

Rebased onto v2.62.0: abortDownload is fork core API missing from the
published @deltachat/jsonrpc-client, so it is now typed locally through
an abortDownload() helper exported from DownloadOnDemandPlaceholder (the
two call sites failed check:types before this rebase as well).
---
 .../_message-download-placeholder.scss        | 40 ++++++++++
 .../message/DownloadOnDemandPlaceholder.tsx   | 74 +++++++++++++++----
 .../src/components/message/Message.tsx        | 10 +++
 3 files changed, 110 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/frontend/scss/message/_message-download-placeholder.scss b/packages/frontend/scss/message/_message-download-placeholder.scss
index 0d3ba43fd0a0a0cded69accbb7a635cf88fad05a..91ff2e518e1b070561c70203a648cb84a5aa219f 100644
--- a/packages/frontend/scss/message/_message-download-placeholder.scss
+++ b/packages/frontend/scss/message/_message-download-placeholder.scss
@@ -260,8 +260,48 @@
     color: var(--colorPrimary, #415e6b);
   }
 
+  // Stop button over the whole ring. Its × takes the percentage's place on
+  // hover/focus, and for good where nothing can hover (touch) or there is no
+  // percentage yet; the arc still shows the progress.
+  .abort {
+    position: absolute;
+    inset: 0;
+    border: none;
+    border-radius: 50%;
+    padding: 0;
+    background: none;
+    cursor: pointer;
+    display: flex;
+    align-items: center;
+    justify-content: center;
+    opacity: 0;
+
+    & > span {
+      background-color: var(--colorPrimary, #415e6b);
+    }
+  }
+  .abort:hover,
+  .abort:focus-visible,
+  &:not(:has(.pct)) .abort {
+    opacity: 1;
+  }
+  &:has(.abort:hover, .abort:focus-visible) .pct {
+    visibility: hidden;
+  }
+  @media (hover: none) {
+    .abort {
+      opacity: 1;
+    }
+    .pct {
+      display: none;
+    }
+  }
+
   // Over a blurred thumbnail the ring needs contrast.
   .download-on-demand-overlay & {
+    .abort > span {
+      background-color: white;
+    }
     .track {
       stroke: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
       opacity: 1;
